      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="Yes">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">For Capacity Development for Ministry of Finance Accounting Training Institute (MoFATC), a Contract was awarded to M/S CoffeyInternational, which developed a 5 year strategic training plan and 1 year annual plan. The capacity development activities for theMoFATC were conducted, which in turn, provided training to government staff.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
